expect Sync
expect Sync is off. Nothing moves until you turn it on.
expect Not run yet
expect-missing Refresh status
expect-missing window
clean
shot syncthing-off
tap-id toggle
expect Sync now
expect Starting
expect Files move with your computer.
expect-missing Sync is off
clean
shot syncthing-on
# The schedule is one answer from a list, with the current one marked.
tap No schedule
wait-for How often Sync runs
expect Once a day
clean
shot syncthing-schedule
tap Every hour
wait-for Runs while Cobalt is open. Tap to change.
expect Every hour
tap Set up Sync
expect Pair one computer folder
expect kobo sync setup
expect turn on Sync here
expect-missing receive-only
clean
shot syncthing-guide
tap Back
tap-id toggle
expect Sync is off
tap Set up Sync
tap Back
expect Paused. Your files stay here.
# Setup step 4 in the Store listing says to turn on the Sync switch: the
# control is one switch named Sync, and no Turn on Sync button exists.
expect-missing Turn on Sync
# Turned on with a schedule, both are kept across a restart.
tap-id toggle
wait-for Files move with your computer.
expect-missing Turn on Sync
expect Starting
tap Every hour
wait-for How often Sync runs
tap Once a day
wait-for Once a day
expect Runs while Cobalt is open. Tap to change.
expect When on Wi-Fi
restart
wait-for Files move with your computer.
expect Once a day
expect-missing Sync is off
clean
shot syncthing-after-restart
# Every schedule can be chosen, and the list closes on the choice.
tap Once a day
wait-for How often Sync runs
tap Every 4 hours
wait-for Every 4 hours
expect-missing How often Sync runs
tap Every 4 hours
wait-for How often Sync runs
tap No schedule
wait-for You start each sync. Tap to change.
expect When you tap Sync now
# Back from the schedule list leaves the schedule as it was.
tap No schedule
wait-for How often Sync runs
tap-id 4294967295
wait-for You start each sync. Tap to change.
# Sync now asks the runtime for a sync. Nothing in the simulator answers,
# so after half a minute the screen says it has not started.
tap Sync now
wait-for Starting a sync.
wait 36000
wait-for Sync has not started.
expect Not started
clean
shot syncthing-not-started
# Turning Sync off clears the request and says files stay put.
tap-id toggle
wait-for Sync is off. Nothing moves until you turn it on.
expect Off
expect-missing Sync now
